{"comment_rankings":{"stormwind":{"2011":{"ids":[173390],"thanked_comments":1,"comment_thanks":1},"2011-11":{"ids":[173390],"thanked_comments":1,"comment_thanks":1},"2012":{"ids":[296514],"thanked_comments":1,"comment_thanks":3},"2012-04":{"ids":[296514],"thanked_comments":1,"comment_thanks":3},"2020":{"ids":[8624116],"thanked_comments":1,"comment_thanks":1},"2020-02":{"ids":[8624116],"thanked_comments":1,"comment_thanks":1}}},"comment_payloads":{"173390":{"id":173390,"topic_id":21488,"commenter":"Livid","thank_count":1,"no":3,"topic_title":"什么时候可以删除项目","content":"在一个多人协作的环境中，项目删除是一个很危险的功能。\n所以目前在经过足够多的测试和考虑之前，V2EX Workspace 暂时不会上线项目删除功能。\n但是项目内的一切信息都是可以更改的，包括项目代号。\n我们会在今年年底之前上线项目删除功能。","create_at":1321394035,"topic_period":"2011-11"},"296514":{"id":296514,"topic_id":33827,"commenter":"Livid","thank_count":3,"no":4,"topic_title":"︸_︸ 三天前Livid就说要把workspace里头像url的错误修好，结果到现在也没修。","content":"Fixed now.\n抱歉，因为这个问题涉及了一些比较复杂的缓存逻辑和 URL 规则，我犯了一点拖延症。\n现在可以正常显示了。","create_at":1335805379,"topic_period":"2012-04"},"8624116":{"id":8624116,"topic_id":648194,"commenter":"also24","thank_count":1,"no":1,"topic_title":"workspace 什么时候下线了吗?","content":"翻到一个旧帖子 /t/592028","create_at":1582819640,"topic_period":"2020-02"}}}